title: A file is edited and saved in the app, then another program appends a line to it: the card must show that line, and editing and saving again must keep it (the diff and the stage of a change rely on the text the app holds)
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/util.rs :: ^// second\n// first\npub fn double[\s\S]*// appended by another program\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/util.rs
wait 1000
edit src/util.rs 1 1
type // first
key enter
key save
wait 1200
key escape
touch src/util.rs // appended by another program
wait 3000
mark 1-after-touch
wait 500
edit src/util.rs 1 1
wait 500
type // second
key enter
wait 500
mark 2-typed
wait 500
key save
wait 1200
quit
wait 1000
answer Close without saving
wait 800
